{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ed0f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b35d-fadf-7f82-925c-5ba6aefcf0a7"},"sequence":5346,"recorded_at":1780531400010687,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"38ee7473-f77a-4937-9e67-866e0a213216","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"38ee7473-f77a-4937-9e67-866e0a213216","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"38ee7473-f77a-4937-9e67-866e0a213216"},"call_id":"call_01a0b385d22f7438accbed3b7e780662","text":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 303-306\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-- P3-3 bound (owner-stated): the absent-store shape fails the\n-  run with the load error (pinned by\n-  `TestRunNoCkptStorePublishedNewestFails`); no silent\n-  proceed-to-launch exists on any path.\n+- P3-3 bound (owner-stated): closure loading runs before the\n+  fencing decision on every path, so a remote-owned session whose\n+  newest checkpoint is absent from the local store (replica lag)\n+  or with no store bound fails the run with the closure/store\n+  error instead of reaching the attach_remote/takeover offer.\n+  The launch-class paths for a remote winner are unreachable\n+  until the local store holds the newest; the bound is\n+  fail-closed (no decision launches without its closure), never\n+  a silent proceed. Deferring the load to launch-class\n+  decisions is future work, not this leaf.\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"internal/axpane/TRACEABILITY.md","added":10,"removed":4},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
