tocol [urn:ax:protocol:session-adapter]\\\",\\n  \\\"Session Adapter manifest [urn:ax:schema:session-adapter-manifest]\\\",\\n  \\\"Session Adapter probe [urn:ax:schema:session-adapter-probe]\\\",\\n  \\\"Directory Node protocol [urn:ax:protocol:session-directory-node]\\\",\\n  \\\"Directory Node manifest [urn:ax:schema:session-directory-node-manifest]\\\",\\n  \\\"Directory Node request [urn:ax:schema:session-directory-node-request]\\\",\\n  \\\"Directory Node response [urn:ax:schema:session-directory-node-response]\\\",\\n  \\\"Mesh RPC [urn:ax:protocol:rpc]\\\",\\n  \\\"Session record [urn:ax:schema:session-record]\\\",\\n  \\\"Session event [urn:ax:schema:session-event]\\\",\\n  \\\"Lease record [urn:ax:schema:lease]\\\",\\n  \\\"Checkpoint record [urn:ax:schema:checkpoint]\\\",\\n  \\\"Workspace group [urn:ax:schema:workspace-group]\\\",\\n  \\\"Provider identity [urn:ax:schema:provider-identity]\\\",\\n  \\\"Blob descriptor [urn:ax:schema:blob]\\\",\\n  \\\"Transfer manifest [urn:ax:sc\\n...\\n{\\n \\\"kind\\\": \\\"section_binding\\\",\\n \\\"keys\\\": [\\n  \\\"section:14.1\\\"\\n ],\\n \\\"production\\\": {\\n  \\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/cliresult/output.go\\\",\\n  \\\"declaration\\\": \\\"Emit\\\"\\n },\\n \\\"acceptance_cases\\\": [\\n  \\\"cli-result-envelope-exact\\\"\\n ],\\n \\\"coverage\\\": \\\"unevidenced\\\",\\n \\\"gap\\\": \\\"Emit formats historical CLI result envelopes only; the Section 14.1 --launch-plan grammar, document validation and launch_plan_invalid refusals are unimplemented. Pending implementation owner: STORY-260916-3fjjtn. The plugin-side profile-flag refusal inside a caller_launch_plan plugin belongs to STORY-260916-1ea7od, not here.\\\"\\n}\\n\\nunowned: [\\n {\\n  \\\"key\\\": \\\"section:18.4\\\",\\n  \\\"gap\\\": \\\"Section 18.4 requires audit retention - the exact Section 5.2 event types for lease change, force confirmation, managed replacement, task-board launch and adoption and tombstone issuance and resolution, and retention of the event and every referenced immutable object for as long as the Session Record. No retention, expiry or garbage-collection rule is implemented.\\\",\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"internal/localstore/projection.go opens, rebuilds and recovers the SQLite projection and installs immutable blobs; it declares no retention, expiry or garbage-collection behaviour, and the binding this entry replaces named OpenProjection with the same two storage acceptance cases already used by the Section 3.3 binding.\\\"\\n },\\n {\\n  \\\"key\\\": \\\"section:11.10.5\\\",\\n  \\\"gap\\\": \\\"Section 11.10.5 defines the upstream public synthetic admission validator, not a runtime requirement to parse SPEC.md during AX host admission. TASK-260830-2x16gz consumes its vectors as source evidence only and implements no policy reader; synthetic passes never establish executed product support. Disclosure owner: TASK-260830-2x16gz.\\\",\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"The pinned section explicitly calls the predicates synthetic execution context and separates detailed DER, custody and runtime boundaries from policy witnesses. No policy-reader declaration exists in the tree; production host-channel admission is proven by the AC-HOST-001 suite over the real Dial/Serve/Call entries instead.\\\"\\n },\\n {\\n  \\\"key\\\": \\\"section:14.7.1\\\",\\n  \\\"gap\\\": \\\"Section 14.7.1 requires literal first-at source-qualified selector grammar with configured source-index resolution; no selector parser or source index exists. Pending implementation owner: TASK-260830-21gygk.\\\",\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"No CLI session commands exist at all: the tree builds no ax binary, sessadapter SourceSelector validates directory-protocol members rather than CLI selectors, and Section 2.3 name precedence is shape validation only.\\\"\\n },\\n {\\n  \\\"key\\\": \\\"section:14.7.2\\\",\\n  \\\"g\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 4112,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1028,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
