n\\\", identifier, n)\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nfunc min(a, b int) int {\\n\\tif a < b {\\n\\t\\treturn a\\n\\t}\\n\\treturn b\\n}\\nEOF\\ngo run ./.temp/inventory 4.B 4.C 4.D 2>&1 | head -n 60\",\n  \"description\": \"Dump clause inventories for story sections\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"4.B#1\\tline=977\\t<code>implementation_kind</code>, and <code>executable_digest</code> MUST equal\\n4.B#2\\tline=978\\tthe Manifest members; its <code>protocol_version</code> MUST be exactly one member\\n4.B#3\\tline=979\\tof <code>protocol_versions</code>, and its <code>platform</code> MUST be exactly\\n4.B#4\\tline=988\\t1. Every <code>M[c]</code> MUST have exactly one <code>P[c]</code>; omission is a\\n4.B#5\\tline=991\\texists, and <code>P[c]</code> MUST then equal <code>M[c]</code> member for\\n4.B#6\\tline=997\\t<code>evidence_requirements</code> MUST remain equal to <code>M[c]</code> and\\n4.B#7\\tline=1001\\tits three registry-derived members MUST equal that row. A Probe cannot add\\n4.B#8\\tline=1013\\t6. <code>evidence_ids</code> MUST be exactly the sorted unique IDs of all\\n4.B#9\\tline=1015\\tEvery referenced object MUST name exactly one present true claim; an ID for\\n4.B#10\\tline=1039\\tomitted. A reader MUST recompute the ID before use. Manifest and Probe remain\\n4.B#11\\tline=1076\\tIdentity MUST NOT be a PID, handle, socket, path, named pipe, URL, token, or\\n4.B#12\\tline=1078\\tSession identity. Boundary conformance cases MUST reject generation lengths 0\\n== 4.B total=12 ==\\n4.C#1\\tline=1113\\t<code>status_first</code>; it MUST NOT claim <code>absent</code>. No operation\\n4.C#2\\tline=1123\\tthe lease tuple MUST equal the current winning AX lease at every side effect.\\n4.C#3\\tline=1155\\tEvery repeated identity MUST equal the request context.\\n4.C#4\\tline=1159\\t<code>{argv:string[3]}</code>, and its three values MUST be literal\\n4.C#5\\tline=1162\\t<code>string[1..4096]</code> usable only on the responding host and MUST NOT be\\n4.C#6\\tline=1189\\tcapability. In <code>attach</code>, the result input boolean MUST equal both the\\n4.C#7\\tline=1195\\tAn error not listed for an operation MUST NOT be emitted by the backend for a\\n== 4.C total=7 ==\\n4.D#1\\tline=1234\\tThe latter three members MUST exactly equal the registry row for the capability;\\n4.D#2\\tline=1296\\tkey registry and MUST verify the signature before treating the object as\\n4.D#3\\tline=1306\\tMUST NOT silently fall back to another backend; defaults apply only to new\\n== 4.D total=3 ==\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2090,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 523,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
