t<code>capability_unavailable</code> with typed realm/readiness details and MUST\\n4.2#8\\tline=1428\\tprovider-auth smoke using the selected provider. Evidence MUST bind the exact\\n4.2#9\\tline=1434\\tAfter restore, the wrapper MUST:\\n4.2#10\\tline=1445\\trealm, recovery MUST remain parked until GUI login re-establishes the broker,\\n4.2#11\\tline=1447\\tbinding. A cached sentinel or prior <code>managername</code> observation MUST\\n== 4.2 total=11 ==\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1410,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 353,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
